'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">全球AI集体大罢工：海外多款主力大模型突发瘫痪超3小时，国内大模型淡定在线</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI证实正自研人形机器人及数据中心特种机器人</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google DeepMind 发布 WeatherNext 3：实现 5 公里分辨率与小时级刷新</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌9月4日起停用安卓端Google Assistant，全面切换至Gemini</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3d4c56ca5191ff6c5b5ae4b6a63a0c6f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于9月4日起正式在安卓手机端停用Google Assistant，并启动用户向Gemini的全面迁移。此次调整覆盖智能手表、耳机及Android Auto等依赖手机智能功能的设备，迁移过程预计持续数周。对于不满足Gemini配置要求的旧设备或未开放地区，Google Assistant将暂时保留，但多数用户将在未来一至两个月内失去访问权限。Android电视、机顶盒及内置Google服务的汽车暂不受影响，后续将通过系统升级完成切换。谷歌表示，此举旨在将“嘿，谷歌”指令从传统语音助手入口升级为生成式AI交互入口，以重构Android生态的系统级交互。尽管Gemini具备更强的生成式能力，但在计时器、音乐播放及天气查询等高频指令的响应稳定性与准确性上，目前仍面临用户反馈的挑战。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达宣布以129.3亿美元收购开源AI平台Hugging Face</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达（NVIDIA）正式宣布以129.303亿美元收购开源AI平台Hugging Face。Hugging Face目前拥有超1800万开发者，托管超过300万个模型、50万个数据集及100万个应用。英伟达此前已在平台发布500多个模型及250多个开放数据集。英伟达CEO黄仁勋承诺，收购完成后Hugging Face将保持平台开放独立属性，继续支持各类开源及开放权重模型，并坚持多云与多加速器环境的发展路线。黄仁勋强调，此举旨在利用英伟达的基础设施与工程能力，将Hugging Face推向全新规模，而非将其改造为封闭的硬件入口。该收购将助力初创公司、企业及科研机构在无需从零训练模型的前提下，灵活调用先进AI能力，推动AI技术在工厂、医院、农场等场景的落地，进一步增强全球开放AI生态的均衡发展。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">全球AI集体大罢工：海外多款主力大模型突发瘫痪超3小时，国内大模型淡定在线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6c291c0e954e49b085d2530517daa36f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">全球AI集体大罢工：海外多款主力大模型突发瘫痪超3小时，国内大模型淡定在线AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 4, 202639月3日美东时间上午9点23分左右，全球人工智能领域遭遇了一场罕见的行业大地震。包括ChatGPT、Claude、Grok、谷歌Gemini以及微软Copilot在内的多款海外头部AI服务集体出现故障，大面积陷入瘫痪状态。此次突发的大规模宕机持续了大约3小时40分钟，给大批海外用户的日常办公与技术调用带来了短暂的困扰。与海外大模型的集体掉线形成鲜明对比的是，国内人工智能大模型在同一时间段内保持了平稳高效的正常运行。其中，国内AI代表企业智谱更是通过社交平台公开幽默发文表态称“我们还在线”，展现出了坚实的底层技术韧性与基础设施承载能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI证实正自研人形机器人及数据中心特种机器人</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b86d0f100045a3facaa2d35ab82d7c28.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI CEO山姆·奥尔特曼近日证实，公司正同步推进人形机器人与数据中心特种机器人的研发，核心战略聚焦于打造通用“机器人大脑”。奥尔特曼指出，人形设计旨在适配人类社会环境，但并非所有场景均需拟人形态。目前，OpenAI已发布GPT-6 Astra模型作为机器人核心大脑，并由Sora负责人阿迪亚·拉梅什领导机器人事业部。硬件层面，OpenAI正重点扩招机器人相关岗位，招聘重心涵盖执行器设计、电磁与齿轮设计等领域，旨在实现定制机电执行器的端到端开发。落地节奏上，OpenAI明确家用机器人并非当前首要任务，基础设施与制造业场景为优先方向，但公司长期看好消费级市场潜力。目前，OpenAI尚未公布具体发货日期与产量规划。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google DeepMind 发布 WeatherNext 3：实现 5 公里分辨率与小时级刷新</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ffbe77738741cca256b1fa6bd79cba81.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google DeepMind 与 Google Research 联合发布 WeatherNext 3 天气模型，通过引入实时全球静止卫星拼图及原始气象站观测数据训练，解决了传统 AI 模型分辨率低及初始化滞后的痛点。该模型采用函数生成网络（FGN）网格 Transformer 架构，支持多分辨率输出：最高 0.05°（约 5 公里）的 2 米气温与露点，以及 0.1° 的风速、降水与太阳辐射等关键变量。相比前代，WeatherNext 3 刷新频率提升至每小时一次，在 00、06、12、18 UTC 周期可预报至 15 天。在降水预测方面，其 CRPS 较基线最高提升 60%。该模型针对可再生能源需求优化了 100 米风速及云层分布预测，被 Brightband 评为当前最准确的全球天气模型。目前数据已通过</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
